## 1. Objective

This project demonstrates practical data analysis skills by applying exploratory data analysis (EDA), statistical techniques, and data visualisation to an environmental dataset. 
The objective is to evaluate river water quality, identify toxin distribution patterns, detect potential environmental risks, and communicate actionable insights through clear and informative visualisations.
